# Defense in depth: neither Dockerfile currently does a blanket `COPY . .`
# (each lists exactly the files/dirs it needs -- see Dockerfile and
# sandbox_worker/Dockerfile), so nothing here is strictly required today.
# This exists so that if a future edit ever adds `COPY . .` under deadline
# pressure, real secrets in .env don't silently end up baked into an image
# layer -- especially now that images are headed to acrstore, where a layer
# persists even after the file is later deleted from the repo.
.env
.git
.gitignore
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
*.zip
DEFERRED_ITEMS.md
